WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:07.290
When I'm in a quiet office reading
a document, my tinnitus distracts me.

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:11.127
I find it very hard to focus
and comprehend what I'm reading,

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:15.630
and sometimes I just get so
frustrated I have to take a break.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:19.990
And so what I do is I get up
and I go get a cup of coffee.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:23.318
And I really like to visit
with this particular

00:00:23.358 --> 00:00:26.660
colleague of mine that really gets it.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.159
And she really understands
because her dad had

00:00:29.199 --> 00:00:32.830
tinnitus as a child
and throughout his adult life.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:38.390
And so I really appreciate her calm
support when my tinnitus is acting up.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:43.690
When I return to my office,
what I like to do is put on some soft music.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.950
That really helps me
to focus on my reading.

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:52.250
And I have much less tinnitus
symptoms after taking a break.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:58.010
So if I do those two things,
it really helps me to feel much less stress.
